  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Small Island Food and Water Security Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to improve food, nutrition and water security and livelihood opportunities in small island communities. It has three intended outcomes: communities are engaged in activities to promote resilience through enhanced food, nutrition and water security; communities, groups and individuals invest in climate-smart local production of nutritious foods and improved water supply, and; well-defined investment plans for food, nutrition and water security are in place in each country.</narrative>
  </description>
